{"quest_id": 8100, "name": "華の国の挑戦者", "description": "開幕の銅鑼が鳴り響き、王子たちの前に\n猛獣を操る熊猫武郎が挑戦者として現れる。\n強敵を打ち破り、勝利を掴め！\n極級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv25）", "event": "武王大宴", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920206, "map_no": 7125, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 100, "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "hp": 80000, "attack": 2000, "base_hp": 80000, "base_attack": 2000, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 100, "attack_speed": 50, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 231, "move_speed": 300.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2148544, "race_id": 16, "special_effect_id": 1566, "master_id": 36688, "global_id": 10305, "spawn_sec": 1}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 25, "form_count": 2, "hp": 4000, "attack": 400, "base_hp": 4000, "base_attack": 400, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 300, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 10, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 106, "move_speed": 220.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2105120, "race_id": 14, "change_to": 2, "change_condition": 5, "master_id": 602, "global_id": 601, "to_condition": 5, "to_global_id": 602, "spawn_sec": 48}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "hp": 4000, "attack": 400, "base_hp": 4000, "base_attack": 400, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 300, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 10, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 106, "move_speed": 2500.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2105136, "race_id": 14, "master_id": 603, "global_id": 602, "from_condition": 5}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 6, "form_count": 2, "hp": 2800, "attack": 400, "base_hp": 2800, "base_attack": 400, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 100, "magic_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 196, "move_speed": 900.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2104272, "race_id": 14, "change_to": 4, "master_id": 517, "global_id": 516, "to_global_id": 517, "route_behaviour": {"transforms": [{}]}, "spawn_sec": 138}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "hp": 2800, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 2800, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 100, "magic_defense": 20, "attack_range": 200, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 105, "move_speed": 900.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2104320, "race_id": 14, "change_to": 3, "missile_id": 131, "missile": {"speed": 12.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 518, "global_id": 517, "ranged": true}, {"enemy_id": 6, "source": "local", "count": 9, "form_count": 2, "tags": ["鳥"], "hp": 5000, "attack": 700, "base_hp": 5000, "base_attack": 700, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 20, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_range": 10, "attack_speed": 65, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 175, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2135760, "race_id": 11, "special_effect_id": 229, "change_to": 6, "change_condition": 4, "missile_id": 692, "missile": {"speed": 1.0}, "master_id": 34778, "global_id": 8395, "ranged": true, "to_condition": 4, "to_ticks": 1, "to_global_id": 8396, "spawn_sec": 156}, {"enemy_id": 6, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "tags": ["鳥"], "hp": 5000, "base_hp": 5000, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 20, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 65, "attack_wait": 10, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2135776, "race_id": 11, "master_id": 34779, "global_id": 8396, "from_condition": 4, "trigger_ticks": 1}], "popups": ["熊猫武郎がいる間は、\n敵の獣、獣人、魔獣、妖獣の\n攻撃と防御がアップします。", "妖虎はHPが減ると、\n移動速度が大幅に上昇します。", "岩を掴んでいるハゲワシは\n一度だけ攻撃を行います。"], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "フーイェン", "text": "……始まった割には誰も挑んで来ませんね。", "face": "u1549a1"}, {"name": "アリス", "text": "まずは様子見、ということでしょうか？", "face": "u288"}, {"name": "クーシン", "text": "おそらく誰が最初に王子に挑むのか、\nお互いに牽制し合っているのでしょう。", "face": "u2000a1"}, {"name": "クーシン", "text": "いくらバトルロワイヤル形式とはいえど、\n折角なら王子と戦いたいのが武人の性です。", "face": "u2000a1"}, {"name": "フーイェン", "text": "あはは！　気持ちは分かりますけどねー！", "face": "u1549a1"}, {"name": "スーシェン", "text": "──警告。どうやら挑戦者が決まったようです。", "face": "u607"}, {"name": "レイメイ", "text": "……大熊猫。", "face": "u457"}, {"name": "アリス", "text": "ええと、パンダと一緒ですね……？", "face": "u288"}, {"name": "スイレン", "text": "パンダの他にも色んな動物がいるねー。\nしかも、みんなやる気満々みたいだよー？", "face": "u751"}, {"name": "クーシン", "text": "あれは猛獣を操る熊猫武郎ですね。\n動物と心を通わせることができるらしく、\n彼の率いる猛獣たちは高い士気を誇ります。", "face": "u2000a1"}, {"name": "クーシン", "text": "特に相棒のパンダとの連携は脅威ですよ。", "face": "u2000a1"}, {"name": "アリス", "text": "なるほど、相手にとって不足なし！\n熊猫武郎さん、いざ尋常に勝負です！", "face": "u288"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "アリス", "text": "せいやーっ！", "face": "u288"}, {"name": "レイメイ", "text": "大熊猫が吹っ飛んダー。", "face": "u457"}, {"name": "フーイェン", "text": "いよっ！　さすが武王の一番弟子！", "face": "u1549a1"}, {"name": "アリス", "text": "もう、やめてくださいよ。\nすごいのは師匠であって、私ではないですし、\nそういうフーイェンさんも大暴れじゃないですか。", "face": "u288"}, {"name": "フーイェン", "text": "いやぁ、武王は全ての武人の憧れですからね。\nあ、後でサインとか書いてもらえたりしますか？", "face": "u1549a1"}, {"name": "アリス", "text": "うーん、師匠に会ったら掛け合ってみますね。", "face": "u288"}, {"name": "フーロン", "text": "（私も欲しい……！）", "face": "u1158a1"}, {"name": "レアン", "text": "うむ、鈍っていた身体もようやくほぐれてきたな。", "face": "u50"}, {"name": "フィリス", "text": "そうか？　怪我明けには結構しんどいんだが……。", "face": "u40"}, {"name": "マレス", "text": "ふぅん、中々悪くない動きだ。\nこれなら遠慮する必要もあるまい。", "face": "l8bb7479cf030"}, {"name": "ウルカノ", "text": "おいおい……お前、また何かする気かよ……。", "face": "u1669a1"}, {"name": "マレス", "text": "フッ、そう急かすなウルカノ。\nこの武王大宴をさらに盛り上げるための、\nとびきりのゲストと連絡がついたところだ。", "face": "l8bb7479cf030"}, {"name": "マレス", "text": "おそらく予選が終わる前には到着するだろう。\nお前たちはそれまでこの宴を存分に楽しむとよい。", "face": "l8bb7479cf030"}]}], "active": true}